Expense Tracker

Project Overview

Expense Tracker is a beginner-friendly Python project that helps users record and manage their daily expenses.

Project Objectives

- Record daily expenses.
- Organize expenses by category.
- View all recorded expenses.
- Calculate total spending.

Features

- Add new expenses.
- Enter expense name, category, and amount.
- Display all recorded expenses.
- Calculate total expenses.
- Simple menu-driven interface.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Google Colab

How It Works

1. Select an option from the menu.
2. Add an expense by entering its name, category, and amount.
3. View all recorded expenses.
4. Check the total spending.
5. Exit the application.

